<title>UK: U-Freight opens office in Seattle.</title>
<headline>U-Freight opens office in Seattle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U-Freight America said it has opened a new representative office in Seattle to meet with increasing demand.</p>
<p>Seattle has seen a &quot;boom&quot; in electronic deliveries and the new office will provide mostly airfreight services via Asia/Pacific route, a spokesman for the logistics and forwarding company told Reuters. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
